abstract: "Two open CSV datasets indexing HMRC UK VAT rules in 2026: all 54 VAT Flat Rate Scheme sector rates plus the 16.5% limited cost business rate and historical 2020-2022 cuts (64 rows), and 147 HMRC VAT rate categories across 20%, 5%, 0%, exempt and outside-scope supplies."
